From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:49:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the Lenovo IdeaPad 5x 2-in-1

The Lenovo IdeaPad 5x 2-in-1 14Q8X9 is built on the Snapdragon X Plus
X1P-42-100. Add its compatible to the X1P42100 boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index f9182dd..4a4a0c1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -1288,6 +1288,7 @@ properties:
               - hp,elitebook-6-g1q
               - hp,omnibook-5
               - hp,omnibook-x14-fe1
+              - lenovo,ideapad-5-2in1
               - lenovo,thinkbook-16
               - qcom,x1p42100-crd
           - const: qcom,x1p42100
-- 
